# Keep LF everywhere: the repo is mounted into Linux containers (ROS 2 / Gazebo),
# and CRLF breaks shebang scripts and launch files. Independent of core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.stl binary
*.STL binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.db  binary
*.bag binary
*.db3 binary
